# Layer: ecommerce (online shop)

Inherits `landing` and `multipage`. No Sanity — `/admin` edits products. Defaults and options:
`docs/adr/0007`, `docs/adr/0008`, `docs/providers-ecommerce.md`. Units: `shop-units.md`.
Addendum: `plan-addendum-ecommerce.md`.

## Providers (exactly one per category)

Kickoff sets **Backend** · **Host** · **Email**. Defaults: `firebase` · `apphosting` · `resend`.
Valid matrix: `docs/providers-ecommerce.md`. Code: `code-firebase.mdc` or `code-supabase.mdc`;
host `code-vercel.mdc` when Host is `vercel`. Changing any provider reopens the **cutover gate**.

## Three references

| Source | Gives | Never gives |
|---|---|---|
| Feature reference (market shop) | flows, fields, labels | look, catalog, photos |
| Design reference (list) | layout, CTA placement | identity |
| Client | brand, copy, products, product photos, prices, policies | — |

Home and editorial photos follow **Photo source**. Product photos stay client files (`design.mdc`).

Feature bands may use a design-band archetype (`feature — archetype of band N`).

## Invariants (cannot waive in chat)

1. Money in integer cents; server totals only; qty 1–99; max 50 lines; merge same variants.
2. Stock changes in **one** DB transaction (Firestore or Postgres RPC). Last unit sells once; never &lt; 0.
3. Order number from a counter in that transaction; line snapshots immutable.
4. Status / paymentStatus / timeline as in ADR 0007. Emails after commit, once per event (`emails.*At`).
5. COD default; cards only on the bank’s hosted page; no card data on our server. Stripe only EU/UK.
6. Admin checked on **every** admin page/action/route (`requireAdmin` or equivalent). Browser never
   holds service credentials; deny-all client DB (Firestore rules or RLS + revoked grants).
7. Guest checkout default; cart clears only on successful place/paid. Turnstile **fail closed** outside
   local test keys. Honeypot first.
8. GA4/Meta after consent; legal pages approved. Routes match the plan sitemap (real 200, not redirect-only).

## Admin · build · done

Admin: products, taxonomy, orders, discounts, content, settings + `docs/admin-guide.md` at ship.
Build: scaffold → shop units → `/qa` → `/ship`. Done: golden-path e2e on the **chosen** runtime,
race + price-tamper green, emails once, inbox proof, consent, backups, admin guide.
